# SailToken's deliberate deviations from the KDBX code copied from
# SailVault (tools/diff-sailvault-core.sh applies this to SailVault's
# files before comparing). The app's name in what KeePassXC shows (the
# Generator of a new file, the sync entry's title and attribute names)
# and in the sync entry's marker, so neither app takes the other's sync
# entry for its own.
--- a/core/src/kdbx/create.rs
+++ b/core/src/kdbx/create.rs
@@ -82,7 +82,7 @@
     element(
         "Meta",
         vec![
-            text("Generator", "SailVault"),
+            text("Generator", "SailToken"),
             text("DatabaseName", name),
             text("DatabaseNameChanged", time),
             text("DatabaseDescription", ""),
